## [​](https://docs.devin.ai/cli/reference/permissions#default-permission-behavior)  Default Permission Behavior
### [​](https://docs.devin.ai/cli/reference/permissions#smart-mode)  Smart Mode
```
devin --permission-mode smart
# or
DEVIN_PERMISSION_MODE=smart devin
```

### [​](https://docs.devin.ai/cli/reference/permissions#autonomous-mode)  Autonomous Mode
```
devin --sandbox --permission-mode autonomous
```

## [​](https://docs.devin.ai/cli/reference/permissions#configuration)  Configuration
```
// .devin/config.json
{
  "permissions": {
    "allow": [\
      "Read(src/**)",\
      "Exec(npm run)"\
    ],
    "deny": [\
      "Exec(rm)"\
    ]
  }
}
```

```
// ~/.config/devin/config.json
{
  "permissions": {
    "allow": [\
      "Read(**)",\
      "Exec(git)"\
    ]
  }
}
```

```
// .devin/config.local.json
{
  "permissions": {
    "allow": [\
      "Exec(docker compose)"\
    ]
  }
}
```

## [​](https://docs.devin.ai/cli/reference/permissions#examples)  Examples
### [​](https://docs.devin.ai/cli/reference/permissions#minimal-development-setup)  Minimal Development Setup
```
{
  "permissions": {
    "allow": [\
      "Read(**)",\
      "Exec(git status)",\
      "Exec(git diff)",\
      "Exec(git log)"\
    ]
  }
}
```

### [​](https://docs.devin.ai/cli/reference/permissions#full-trust-for-a-project)  Full Trust for a Project
```
{
  "permissions": {
    "allow": [\
      "Read(**)",\
      "Write(src/**)",\
      "Write(tests/**)",\
      "Exec(npm)",\
      "Exec(git)",\
      "Exec(node)"\
    ],
    "deny": [\
      "Exec(rm -rf)",\
      "Exec(sudo)",\
      "Write(.env*)"\
    ]
  }
}
```

## [​](https://docs.devin.ai/cli/extensibility/configuration#config-file-locations)  Config File Locations
```
{
  "agent": { "model": "claude-sonnet-4.5" },
  "permissions": {
    "allow": ["Read(**)", "Exec(git)"]
  }
}
```

```
// .devin/config.json
{
  "permissions": {
    "allow": ["Exec(npm run)", "Read(src/**)"],
    "deny": ["Exec(sudo)"]
  }
}
```

